<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-πρίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ρῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>saw through, saw asunder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				768
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				4.2
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπίμπρημι</span>);
				<i>split,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύμινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					312a
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πεπρισμένα [ξύλα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					2587.304
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεπρισμένα ἡμίσε᾽ . . ὡσπερεὶ τὰ
					σύμβολα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					70
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεπρίοντο ταῖς καρδίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					7.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.33
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πλείω δ. τὴν Παλαιστίνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					334
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοὺς ὀδόντας</span>
			<i>gnash</i> the teeth, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cal.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπρίεται: διαγοράζει, μαίνεται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
